stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SCHEDULED: created with a future executeAt
    [*] --> PENDING_ACCEPTANCE: created without executeAt, funds held now
    SCHEDULED --> PENDING_ACCEPTANCE: due, funds held from source
    SCHEDULED --> FAILED: due, but daily limit or balance insufficient
    SCHEDULED --> CANCELLED: cancelled
    PENDING_ACCEPTANCE --> COMPLETED: accepted, target credited
    PENDING_ACCEPTANCE --> EXPIRED: not accepted in time, funds returned to source
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
